UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'American mah jongg in West Hartford centres on River Bend Bookshop. The shop holds multi-week courses, a 101 beginner course and a 102 intermediate course taught by local instructor Linda Houde, plus an open studio evening for players who bring their own National Mahjong League card. Classes meet on Monday evenings and tickets are sold through Eventbrite, so book ahead. If you have never played, start with the 101 beginner course: it introduces the game from the tiles up before you join an open studio.' WHERE "slug" = 'west-hartford';
